-     * Rows and [metricRows] are updated in place; returns each rescored day's (rest, recovery).
+     * Each freshly scored row of [dailies] (all under [computedId]) gets the Rest of its night written into
+     * [metricRows] in place of the one the pass wrote, and the Charge [recovery] recomputes with it (the row's
